1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,620
As kids, we love the heroes, but as adults, we understand the villains.

2
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:11,380
Life teaches us that people aren't simply good or bad.

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:17,120
Sometimes the villain is just someone who got tired of being hurt, someone who stopped

4
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:22,020
explaining themselves, someone who finally chose themselves after being forgotten.
